IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `roc-core`
IMPORT `roc10-order-49`

-- Rules of Court 2021 (Singapore), Order 49 (Land Titles (Strata) Act: collective sale applications): TESTS.
-- Every expected value is written beside its assertion from the text of the rule it cites (lines 6297 to 6423 of the text),
-- never copied from the output of the code.  Last days are worked out by hand under O 3 r 3.

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Rule 1 (lines 6300 to 6310): definitions.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 the definitions in this Rule apply` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- no contrary context
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 the definitions in this Rule apply` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "unless the context otherwise requires"
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 an instrument is the Act` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- "“Act” means the Land Titles (Strata) Act"
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 an instrument is the Act` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- another instrument
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 a reference to a section is a reference to a section in the Land Titles (Strata) Act` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- "any reference to a section is a reference to a section in the Act"
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 a reference to a section is a reference to a section in the Land Titles (Strata) Act` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- some other kind of reference
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 a proceeding is an application` TRUE TRUE `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- an application under (a) section 84A(1) after a stop order
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 a proceeding is an application` TRUE TRUE `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- an application under (b) section 84D(2) after a stop order
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 a proceeding is an application` TRUE TRUE `o 49 r 1(c) section 84E(3) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84E applies` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- an application under (c) section 84E(3) after a stop order
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 a proceeding is an application` TRUE TRUE `o 49 r 1(d) section 84FA(2) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan to which section 84FA applies` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- an application under (d) section 84FA(2) after a stop order
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 a proceeding is an application` TRUE TRUE `o 49 r 1 another provision of the Act` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- under another provision: not an "application"
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 a proceeding is an application` TRUE FALSE `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- no stop order issued first: "after the issue of a stop order"
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 a proceeding is an application` FALSE TRUE `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- not an application to the General Division
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 a body is a Board` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a Strata Titles Board
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 a body is a Board` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- another body
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 an order is a stop order` TRUE `o 49 r 1 section 84A(6A)(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- issued by a Board under ection 84A(6A)(b)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 an order is a stop order` TRUE `o 49 r 1 section 84D(4A)(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- issued by a Board under ection 84D(4A)(b)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 an order is a stop order` TRUE `o 49 r 1 section 84E(6A)(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- issued by a Board under ection 84E(6A)(b)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 an order is a stop order` TRUE `o 49 r 1 section 84FA(5A)(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- issued by a Board under ection 84FA(5A)(b)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 an order is a stop order` TRUE `o 49 r 1 another provision` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- under another provision
#ASSERT `o 49 r 1 an order is a stop order` FALSE `o 49 r 1 section 84A(6A)(b)` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- not issued by a Board

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Rule 2 (lines 6312 to 6342): commencement of proceedings.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(1) the application must be made by originating application` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- an application
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(1) the application must be made by originating application` `o 49 r 1 another provision of the Act` EQUALS NOTHING -- not an application as defined
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(1) the application is made by originating application as it must be` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` `Originating application` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- made by originating application
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(1) the application is made by originating application as it must be` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` `Summons` EQUALS NOTHING -- made by summons: a bare "must", not done
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(1) the application is made by originating application as it must be` `o 49 r 1 another provision of the Act` `Summons` EQUALS NOTHING -- not an application
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(1) the application is made within the time limited by the Act` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- within the time the Act limits
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(1) the application is made within the time limited by the Act` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- outside the time the Act limits
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(1) the application is made within the time limited by the Act` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING -- sections 84A(2B) etc. are not among the sources
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2 the person has been named as a defendant as required` (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- the duty arises and the person is named
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2 the person has been named as a defendant as required` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- the duty arises and the person is not named: a bare "must"
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2 the person has been named as a defendant as required` (JUST FALSE) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- the duty does not arise
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2 the person has been named as a defendant as required` NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- the duty is not engaged
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(a) a subsidiary proprietor must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a subsidiary proprietor who has not agreed and who objected
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(a) a subsidiary proprietor must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(d) section 84FA(2) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan to which section 84FA applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a subsidiary proprietor who has not agreed and who objected
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(a) a subsidiary proprietor must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- an application under section 84D(2) is governed by paragraph (3)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(a) a subsidiary proprietor must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- not a subsidiary proprietor of a lot in the plan
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(a) a subsidiary proprietor must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- agreed to sell: outside the class
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(a) a subsidiary proprietor must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- did not object in time: outside the class
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a mortgagee with a notified interest who objected
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(d) section 84FA(2) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan to which section 84FA applies` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- section 84FA(2)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- a lessee: "(other than a lessee)" takes the person out of the class
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- a lessee is outside the duty whatever the other limbs say: the exclusion is the text's own
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- neither a mortgagee, chargee or other person nor a lessee: the class is described by "who" and "with", and a person outside it is neither required nor forbidden to be named
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- no interest in a lot referred to in (a)(i)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- interest not notified on the land-register
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(2)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- did not object in time
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(3)(a) a proprietor of a flat must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a proprietor of a flat who has not agreed in writing and who objected
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(3)(a) a proprietor of a flat must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(c) section 84E(3) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84E applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- section 84E(3) is governed by paragraph (4)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(3)(a) a proprietor of a flat must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- agreed in writing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(3)(a) a proprietor of a flat must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- did not object in time
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(3)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a mortgagee with a notified interest who objected
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(3)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- a lessee: "(other than a lessee)" takes the person out of the class
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(3)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- a lessee is outside the duty whatever the other limbs say: the exclusion is the text's own
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(3)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- neither a mortgagee, chargee or other person nor a lessee: the class is described by "who" and "with", and a person outside it is neither required nor forbidden to be named
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(3)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- an application under section 84A(1) is governed by paragraph (2)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(3)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- a lessee, but the application is under section 84A(1): governed by paragraph (2), so this paragraph does not speak
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(4)(a) a proprietor of a flat must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(c) section 84E(3) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84E applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- section 84E(3)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(4)(a) a proprietor of a flat must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- section 84D(2) is governed by paragraph (3)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(4)(a) a proprietor of a flat must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(c) section 84E(3) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84E applies` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- agreed in writing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(4)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(c) section 84E(3) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84E applies` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a mortgagee with a notified interest who objected
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(4)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(c) section 84E(3) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84E applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- a lessee: "(other than a lessee)" takes the person out of the class
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(4)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(c) section 84E(3) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84E applies` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- a lessee is outside the duty whatever the other limbs say: the exclusion is the text's own
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(4)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(c) section 84E(3) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84E applies` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- neither a mortgagee, chargee or other person nor a lessee: a person outside the class is neither required nor forbidden to be named
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(4)(b) a mortgagee, chargee or other person must be named as a defendant` `o 49 r 1(c) section 84E(3) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84E applies` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- interest not notified
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(5) Order 6 Rules 11 to 14, Order 9 and Order 15 Rule 7 apply to the originating application` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- not modified in this Order
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(5) Order 6 Rules 11 to 14, Order 9 and Order 15 Rule 7 apply to the originating application` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "unless expressly modified in this Order"
#ASSERT `o 49 r 2(5) Order 6 Rules 11 to 14, Order 9 and Order 15 Rule 7 apply to the originating application` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- not an originating application under this Rule

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Rule 3 (line 6344).
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#ASSERT `o 49 r 3 the originating application and supporting affidavits are served on every defendant as they must be` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- served on every defendant
#ASSERT `o 49 r 3 the originating application and supporting affidavits are served on every defendant as they must be` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- not served on every defendant: a bare "must"
#ASSERT `o 49 r 3 the originating application and supporting affidavits are served on every defendant as they must be` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- not the originating application in a proceeding under this Order

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Rule 4 (lines 6346 to 6393): supporting affidavits.
-- Originating application served on the last defendant on 1 June 2026: 14 days begin on 2 June and end on 15 June 2026 (Monday).
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(1) the period after service of the originating application on the last defendant`'s `period length` EQUALS 14 -- "not later than 14 days"
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(1) the period after service of the originating application on the last defendant`'s `period direction` EQUALS `After the anchor` -- "after the service"
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(1) the duty to adduce the evidence by affidavit arises` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- an application and the claimants intend to adduce evidence
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(1) the duty to adduce the evidence by affidavit arises` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "Where the claimants intend to adduce evidence"
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(1) the duty to adduce the evidence by affidavit arises` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- not an originating application that is an application
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(1) the evidence has been adduced by affidavit filed and served in time` TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 15 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- by affidavit, on the last day
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(1) the evidence has been adduced by affidavit filed and served in time` TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 16 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- by affidavit, a day late
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(1) the evidence has been adduced by affidavit filed and served in time` TRUE TRUE FALSE (Date 10 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) EQUALS NOTHING -- not by affidavit: a bare "must"
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(1) the evidence has been adduced by affidavit filed and served in time` TRUE FALSE TRUE (Date 10 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) EQUALS NOTHING -- the claimants do not intend to adduce evidence: nothing to comply with
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(1) the evidence has been adduced by affidavit filed and served in time` FALSE TRUE TRUE (Date 10 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) EQUALS NOTHING -- not an application
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- every particular, all representatives
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(d) section 84FA(2) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan to which section 84FA applies` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- section 84FA(2)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (i) missing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (ii) missing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (iii) missing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (iv) missing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (v) missing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (vi) missing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (vii) missing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (viii) missing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (ix) missing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (x) missing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (xi) missing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(a) section 84A(1) for an order for the sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan` FALSE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- not made by or with the authority of all the authorised representatives
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- an application under section 84D(2) is governed by sub-paragraph (b)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(b) the affidavit for an application under section 84D(2) or 84E(3) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(b) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- every particular, all representatives
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(b) the affidavit for an application under section 84D(2) or 84E(3) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(c) section 84E(3) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84E applies` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(b) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- section 84E(3)
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(b) the affidavit for an application under section 84D(2) or 84E(3) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(b) what the affidavit sets out` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (i) missing
#ASSERT `o 49 r 4(2)(b) the affidavit for an application under section 84D(2) or 84E(3) is as it must be` `o 49 r 1(b) section 84D(2) for an order for the sale of all the flats and the land in a development to which section 84D applies` TRUE (`o 49 r 4(2)(b) what the affidavit sets out` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- particular (ii) missing
